         and ignored, so the x86 viewer keeps today's drop-the-file behaviour exactly
         (011_SPECIFICATION_SLOT_HEALTH_AND_HONEST_FAILURES_DOTNET10.md §5, invariant 10). -->
    <Compile Include="PathFailure.vb" />
